  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A child stands on the edge of the cliff <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;above the ground and throws a stone horizontally with an initial speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . Neglecting the air resistance, the speed with which the stone hits the ground will be _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup></math> ).",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Uvvik",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XKo8f",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p1KqX",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "35lhq",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b7e6c150-0f85-4f13-a5e8-95659b4b1627-9896234.PNG\" style=\"width: 234px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;in vertical direction, we have the velocity of stone in vertical direction as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>200</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>).</p><p>The final velocity along the horizontal direction is the same as the initial horizontal velocity as there is no acceleration along the x-axis.</p><p>The speed&nbsp;with which the stone hits the ground is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
